Scope: nine stateless bbt-ui atom painters, isolated native gallery and glyph/icon parity. No L6 components, module rebases, input, clocks, dependencies, design edits or L1 shader changes.

Acceptance evidence:
crates/bbt-ui/src/atoms.rs:9 — AtomCtx injects DrawCtx, TextMeasure and scale; the library owns no font selection, GPU, layout tree or timer.
crates/bbt-ui/src/atoms.rs:43 — Atom::paint emits the shared draw list. Hairline, Glyph, Icon, Badge, Chip, Pill, Swatch, Spinner and Checkerboard implemented.
crates/bbt-ui/src/atoms.rs:77 — activity, grade and waiting kind compose independently; state colour and ring/mark geometry are atom-owned.
crates/bbt-ui/src/atoms.rs:244 — Pill reuses the L3 shadow token resolver; no copied shadow dimensions.
crates/bbt-ui/tests/atoms.rs — state/grade/kind independence, one-physical-pixel hairline at 1/2/3x, explicit repeatable spinner phase, logical icon name/tint, dim applied once to waiting mark.
crates/bboxybook/src/atoms.rs — nine painters x four densities x two themes = 72 native previews; 112 canonical page/state/density/theme reference cases.
crates/bboxybook/capture-inputs.js:59 — L5-only atom records with bounds, identity, activity/grade/kind and tint; no screenshot is used as a native glyph/icon.
crates/bboxybook/capture.mjs — current committed lab references for L5, pulse fixed at 0 ms; .glyph/.hicon hidden in the shared diagnostic/checker backdrop.

